# Keep GitHub snapshot tarballs small enough for the Portals build worker.
#
# Portals' GitHub sync downloads a snapshot archive of this repository and
# fails with SOURCE_ARCHIVE_FAILED when that archive is too large. The asset
# pipeline's reference images and render evidence under assets/ are 137 MB of
# the 147 MB archive and are never imported by any built code (verified: no
# ts/tsx import references assets/). export-ignore leaves them in the
# repository and its history but out of downloaded archives.
/assets/ export-ignore
